## Step 1: Install the prerequisites

Before anything else, make sure you have these on your computer. Open your **Terminal** (Mac) or **Command Prompt** (Windows) and run each check:

```bash
# Check Python (need 3.9+)
python --version

# Check Node.js (need 18+)
node --version

# Check npm
npm --version
```

If any of these say "command not found", install them first:
- **Python** → [python.org/downloads](https://python.org/downloads)
- **Node.js** → [nodejs.org](https://nodejs.org) (download the LTS version)

