## Step 2: Create your project folders

Copy and paste this block into your terminal **line by line**:

```bash
# Go to your home/desktop area
cd ~/Desktop

# Create the main project folder
mkdir pitchmind
cd pitchmind

# Create the backend folder
mkdir backend
cd backend

# Create a Python virtual environment (an isolated box for your Python packages)
python -m venv venv

# Activate it (Mac/Linux)
source venv/bin/activate

# Activate it (Windows — use this instead of the line above)
# venv\Scripts\activate

# You should now see (venv) at the start of your terminal line — that means it worked
```

