## Step 5: Start your backend server

```bash
# Make sure you're in the backend/ folder with (venv) active
uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
```

You should see:
```
INFO:     Uvicorn running on http://127.0.0.1:8000 (Press CTRL+C to quit)
```

Open your browser and go to `http://localhost:8000/docs` — FastAPI gives you a free test interface. Click `/api/chat` → Try it out → fill in the fields → Execute. If you get a response back, your backend is alive. 🎉

